flowchart TD
  A["Define delivery requirement"] --> B{"Must sender deliver while recipient is offline?"}
  B -->|No| C["Evaluate reviewed synchronous authenticated session designs"]
  B -->|Yes| D["Evaluate reviewed asynchronous / prekey-based designs"]
  C --> E["Bind protocol credentials to verified participant identity"]
  D --> E
  E --> F{"What does sender authentication mean?"}
  F -->|Recipient-side peer authentication| G["Specify directional session authentication"]
  F -->|Transferable proof required| H["Specify message signatures and attribution limits"]
  G --> I["Freeze canonical envelope and authenticated context"]
  H --> I
  I --> J["Select reviewed KDF / AEAD profile and nonce rules"]
  J --> K["Specify replay state and key lifecycle"]
  K --> L["Bind bounded multipart manifest and reconstruction rules"]
  L --> M["Threat review and adversarial test plan"]
  M --> N["Only then consider implementation readiness"]

  classDef decision fill:#fff1cc,stroke:#9a6b00,color:#503700
  classDef output fill:#dcefe5,stroke:#28734a,color:#123d28
  class B,F decision
  class C,D,E,G,H,I,J,K,L,M,N output
